---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Best Country for Africans to Migrate To | AfriMigrate"
  description="Explore all six migration destinations AfriMigrate covers for Africans — Canada, UK, Australia, Netherlands, Belgium and the United States — with every legal visa route."
>
  <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Destinations</div>
  <div class="eyebrow">Destinations</div>
  <h1>Where do you want to go?</h1>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
    There's no single "best" country — it depends on your profession, savings, and whether you already have a job offer. Here's an honest look at every destination AfriMigrate covers.
  </p>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="tools-grid">
      <div class="tool-card">
        <div class="hot">Most popular</div>
        <div class="tool-icon">🇨🇦</div>
        <h3>Canada</h3>
        <p>The most transparent points-based system. No job offer needed for Express Entry, and 11 provinces run their own nominee programs.</p>
        <a href="/canada" class="tool-link">Explore Canada →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="tool-card">
        <div class="tool-icon">🇬🇧</div>
        <h3>United Kingdom</h3>
        <p>Sponsor-led system best for professionals in healthcare, IT, engineering and education who can secure a licensed sponsor.</p>
        <a href="/uk" class="tool-link">Explore the UK →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="tool-card">
        <div class="tool-icon">🇦🇺</div>
        <h3>Australia</h3>
        <p>Skills-first, points-tested system with no job offer required for the main independent visa.</p>
        <a href="/australia" class="tool-link">Explore Australia →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="tool-card">
        <div class="tool-icon">🇳🇱</div>
        <h3>Netherlands</h3>
        <p>One of Europe's fastest work-permit systems, with a genuinely useful tax break for skilled migrants.</p>
        <a href="/netherlands" class="tool-link">Explore the Netherlands →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="tool-card">
        <div class="tool-icon">🇧🇪</div>
        <h3>Belgium</h3>
        <p>Real, current shortages in IT and healthcare, with regional shortage-occupation exemptions that skip the labour market test.</p>
        <a href="/belgium" class="tool-link">Explore Belgium →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="tool-card">
        <div class="tool-icon">🇺🇸</div>
        <h3>United States</h3>
        <p>Highly competitive employer routes, but also home to the free Diversity Visa lottery — open to almost every African country.</p>
        <a href="/us" class="tool-link">Explore the USA →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="eyebrow">Not Sure Yet?</div>
    <h2>Compare them side by side</h2>
    <p class="lead">See cost, timeline, and job offer requirements across our top destinations in one table.</p>
    <a href="/compare" class="btn-primary" style="margin-top: 1rem;">Compare destinations →</a>
  </section>
</Layout>
